@startuml find-states
' The find box. Colours: grey = closed, blue = open and idle, green = a hit
' is selected, yellow = waiting for a layout.
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #52687A
  ArrowColor #52687A
  FontColor #182734
}
title Find in page: states and the selection invariant

[*] --> Closed
state "Closed\n~#findbar.off · no hits · no find selection" as Closed #EDEDED
state "Open" as Open #F5F7FA {
  state "Empty query\nghost hint · no selection" as Empty #DDEBF7
  state "Matching\nhits from the laid-out page\nhit i selected and revealed" as Matching #E2EFDA
  state "No match\ncount 0/0 in danger colour" as NoMatch #FCE4D6
  state "Waiting for layout\nfind_rescan = true\nPacer wakes in 30 ms" as Waiting #FFF2CC
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty --> Matching : Input(q), page laid out,\nq occurs
  Empty --> NoMatch : Input(q), page laid out,\nq absent
  Empty --> Waiting : Input(q), page not laid out
  Waiting --> Matching : poll(): laid out, q occurs
  Waiting --> NoMatch : poll(): laid out, q absent
  Matching --> Matching : Enter / Shift+Enter\n(next / previous, wraps)
  Matching --> Empty : Input("")\n(clear_find_selection)
  NoMatch --> Empty : Input("")
  Matching --> NoMatch : Input(q'), absent
  NoMatch --> Matching : Input(q'), occurs
  Matching --> Matching : select(tab): clear the old\ntab's selection, search the new
}
Closed --> Open : Ctrl+F or toolbar magnifier\nfocus #find, select its text
Open --> Closed : Esc or ×\nclear find's selection only,\nfocus returns to the page

note right of Matching
  <b>Invariant</b> (ledger L1)
  find has a selection
  ⇔ the box is open
  ∧ the query is non-empty
  ∧ there is a hit
  ∧ the selection is on the active tab.
  A selection the user made is never
  cleared by find (find_selected_tab).
end note
@enduml
